[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7261.109, "timestamp": "02:01:01", "text": "6年后坏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7267.03, "timestamp": "02:01:07", "text": "GPU 2060 和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7272.07, "timestamp": "02:01:12", "text": "Ryzen 7 3800X 都坏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7275.75, "timestamp": "02:01:15", "text": "实际上，是G CPU先坏了，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7285.189, "timestamp": "02:01:25", "text": "但是对于 OBS，我建议"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7287.75, "timestamp": "02:01:27", "text": "你把图像源媒体源"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7290.229, "timestamp": "02:01:30", "text": "处理器的那些设置调成“"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7296.79, "timestamp": "02:01:36", "text": "否”，这样当你不在画面上时，它就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7299.75, "timestamp": "02:01:39", "text": "不会在后台处理"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7303.189, "timestamp": "02:01:43", "text": "等等。 减少资源消耗，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7306.07, "timestamp": "02:01:46", "text": "减少浏览器资源占用，这对"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7309.109, "timestamp": "02:01:49", "text": "我的健康有益。 就我而言，我现在使用的是 Mel"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7312.47, "timestamp": "02:01:52", "text": "Studio，不再使用 OBS 了。 我只在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7314.709, "timestamp": "02:01:54", "text": "直播对GPU要求"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7317.75, "timestamp": "02:01:57", "text": "很高的游戏时才使用Obvious。 所以，这只是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7319.75, "timestamp": "02:01:59", "text": "或两个游戏画面的"}]